# Tor for the Railway SearXNG — CLIENT ONLY, egress for the search engines.
#
# Why: from the Railway datacentre IP every web engine was blocked
# (2026-09-14: google cse / brave "Suspended: too many requests", qwant /
# duckduckgo / startpage CAPTCHA, mojeek timeout — zero results). Measured
# through Tor the same evening: duckduckgo (html) 0.9-2.0 s / 10 hits, the
# Brave Search onion 3.6-4.3 s / 23-26 hits, warm circuits.
#
# The SOCKS port listens on loopback only: nothing outside this container can
# use this Tor client.
SocksPort 127.0.0.1:9050
ClientOnly 1
DataDirectory /tmp/tor-data
AvoidDiskWrites 1
Log notice file /tmp/tor.log
GeoIPFile /opt/tor/share/geoip
GeoIPv6File /opt/tor/share/geoip6
